      "content": "I hear how painful and isolating that feeling of hollowness and \"gray fog\" must be, even when life seems to be perfect on the outside. This emotional disconnect is a valid experience that can occur without a specific life event to trigger it. I encourage you to consider speaking with a mental health professional, as they can help you explore these empty feelings in a safe and supportive way. You don't need to \"fix\" everything to deserve help in the same way a broken leg would.",
